><h3 class=\"Base-h4 u-marginBottom--2\">\n                      Lütjenmoor Norderstedt\n                    </h3><p class=\"Base-p\">Modern und barrierearm: Frisch renoviert erstrahlt das Quartier Lütjenmoor in neuem Glanz.</p><p class=\"Base-p\"><a class=\"Base-iconLink-intern\" href=\"/wohnen/fuer-wohnungssuchende/unsere-wohnquartiere/quartiersdetails/luetjenmoor-norderstedt/\">\n                        Details zum Quartier\n                      </a></p></div></div></div><div class=\"TeaserSlider-teaserImage-grid js-teaserslider u-float--right\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-item-grid js-teaserslider-items u-edgeLeft--pear\"><figure class=\"TeaserSlider-item\"><div\n                            class=\"TeaserSlider-image LazyBgImage js-lazybgimage js-scrollcontrol is-notReplaced u-print-hide\"\n                            style=\"background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3562_96af303958.jpg');\"\n                            data-lazybgimage-src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/3/3/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3562_6c495f7690.jpg\"\n                            data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-120\"></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption Base-theme--quartz\"><div class=\"imageCaption-container\"><h2 class=\"Base-h1\">Lütjenmoor Norderstedt</h2></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"TeaserSlider-item\"><div\n                            class=\"TeaserSlider-image LazyBgImage js-lazybgimage js-scrollcontrol is-notReplaced u-print-hide\"\n                            style=\"background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/f/1/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3579_5950b7d3e8.jpg');\"\n                            data-lazybgimage-src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/f/1/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3579_dcbe8cb5f8.jpg\"\n                            data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-120\"></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption Base-theme--quartz\"><div class=\"imageCaption-container\"><h2 class=\"Base-h1\">Lütjenmoor Norderstedt</h2></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"TeaserSlider-item\"><div\n                            class=\"TeaserSlider-image LazyBgImage js-lazybgimage js-scrollcontrol is-notReplaced u-print-hide\"\n                            style=\"background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3582_882f9096e6.jpg');\"\n                            data-lazybgimage-src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3582_d93bf4a519.jpg\"\n                            data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-120\"></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption Base-theme--quartz\"><div class=\"imageCaption-container\"><h2 class=\"Base-h1\">Lütjenmoor Norderstedt</h2></div></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"TeaserSlider-item\"><div\n                            class=\"TeaserSlider-image LazyBgImage js-lazybgimage js-scrollcontrol is-notReplaced u-print-hide\"\n                            style=\"background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/0/f/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3588_95c71cc00b.jpg');\"\n                            data-lazybgimage-src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/0/f/csm_2019_04_10-ADLERSHORSTDSC_3588_195e1198b0.jpg\"\n                            data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-120\"></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption Base-theme--quartz\"><div class=\"imageCaption-container\"><h2 class=\"Base-h1\">Lütjenmoor Norderstedt</h2></div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"TeaserSlider-navigation-grid\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-navigation\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-dots-grid js-teaserslider-dots\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"c142\" class=\"Base-theme--white u-background--white  u-paddingBottom--r2\"><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-lg\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12\"><div class=\"KeyFacts\"><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">5.631</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Wohnungen\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      sind das Zuhause unserer Mieter\n                    </p></div><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">361.251 m²</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Wohnfläche\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      bieten viel Freiraum zum Leben\n                    </p></div><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">9.252</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Mitglieder\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      machen eine starke Gemeinschaft\n                    </p></div></div><div class=\"Base-p u-textAlign--right u-marginTop--r1\"><a href=\"/adlershorst/das-ist-adlershorst/\" class=\"Base-iconLink-intern\">\n                  Mehr über Adlershorst\n                </a></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"c583\" class=\"GridEdge-grid Base-theme--white u-background--white  u-paddingTop--r2 \"><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-lg\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12 u-col-md-10\"><h2 class=\"Base-h2\">Neubauprojekte für Mieter</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-sm\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12\"><div id=\"c584\" class=\"RTE RTE--text  \"><p>Heiß begehrt! Was gibt es Schöneres als eine frisch modernisierte Wohnung? Oder ein neues Zuhause, in dem noch niemand vor Ihnen gewohnt hat. Mitunter bestimmen Sie sogar mit, wie Ihre Wohnung gestaltet wird.</p><p><a href=\"/wohnen/fuer-wohnungssuchende/aktuelle-neubauprojekte/\" class=\"Base-button\">Aktuelle Neubauprojekte</a></p></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"c644\" class=\"Base-theme--white u-background--white \n      \n     \n       u-paddingBottom--r2\n     u-clearfix\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider \n      Base-theme--pear u-background--pear\n     u-clearfix u-print-hide\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-container u-container u-limitWidth-lg u-background--pear\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-teaserCopy-grid u-float--right\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-headline-grid\"><h3 class=\"Base-h4 u-marginBottom--2\">\n                    Wenn aus Wohnen Lebenslust wird\n                  </h3><p class=\"Base-p\">Am Exerzierplatz in Norderstedt präsentiert sich ein Wohnprojekt mit besonderem Charakter. In 4 Bauabschnitten entstand buchstäblich „Levenslust“.</p><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                    \n                      Mehr dazu\n                    \n                  </p></div></div></div><div class=\"TeaserSlider-teaserImage-grid js-teaserslider u-float--left\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-item-grid js-teaserslider-items \n      u-edgeRight--pear\n    \"><figure class=\"TeaserSlider-item\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-image LazyBgImage js-lazybgimage js-scrollcontrol is-notReplaced u-focusPoint--center u-print-hide\"\n                          style=\"background-image: url('/fileadmin/_processed_/1/0/csm_63_IN_SONNE_01_dec451e6cd.jpg');\"\n                          data-lazybgimage-src=\"/fileadmin/_processed_/1/0/csm_63_IN_SONNE_01_7f745be7e3.jpg\"\n                          data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-120\"></div><figcaption class=\"imageCaption Base-theme--quartz\"><div class=\"imageCaption-container\"><h2 class=\"Base-h1\">Stadtquartier Levenslust</h2></div></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"TeaserSlider-navigation-grid\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-navigation\"><div class=\"TeaserSlider-dots-grid js-teaserslider-dots\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"c558\" class=\"Base-theme--white u-background--white  u-paddingBottom--r2\"><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-lg\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12\"><div class=\"KeyFacts\"><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">96,8 Mio. €</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Eigenkapital\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      sind ein solides Fundament\n                    </p></div><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">509,6 Mio. €</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Bilanzsumme\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      untermauern unsere Kompetenz\n                    </p></div><div class=\"KeyFacts-fact\"><h3 class=\"Base-h2 Base-h2--large\"><span class=\"\" data-keyfact-decimalplaces=\"0\" data-scrollcontrol-threshold=\"-60\">8,0 Mio. €</span></h3><h4 class=\"Base-h4\">\n                      Jahresüberschuss\n                    </h4><p class=\"Base-p\">\n                      unterstreichen unseren Erfolg\n                    </p></div></div><div class=\"Base-p u-textAlign--right u-marginTop--r1\"><a href=\"/downloads/\" class=\"Base-iconLink-intern\">\n                  Mehr Kennzahlen in unseren Publikationen\n                </a></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"c570\" class=\"GridEdge-grid Base-theme--white u-background--white  u-paddingTop--r2 \"><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-lg\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12 u-col-md-10\"><h2 class=\"Base-h2\">Bauprojekte für Investoren</h2></div></div></div><div class=\"u-container u-limitWidth-sm\"><div class=\"u-row\"><div class=\"u-col-12\"><div id=\"c571\" class=\"RTE RTE--text  \"><p>Setzen Sie mit uns neue Maßstäbe für die Zukunft. Mit innovativen Bauprojekten, in denen über 75 Jahre Erfahrung stecken. Mit Konzepten, die aktuelle Trends in der Wohnungswirtschaft aufgreifen. Und mit Investitionen, die sich für Sie auszahlen.</p><p><a href=\"/investieren-bauen-verwalten/fuer-investoren/referenzen/\" class=\"Base-button\">Aktuelle Bauprojekte</a></p></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n    </div>\n    \n  \n    <section id=\"notification\" class=\"Notification-section\">\n      <div  class=\"Notification u-print-hide\">\n        <div class=\"Notification-note\">\n          <div class=\"Notification-iconWrap\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"Notification-icon\" width=\"69\" height=\"58\" viewBox=\"0 0 69 58\">\n              <g fill-rule=\"evenodd\">\n                <path d=\"M41.5520097,7.52306903 C42.4566332,9.71212639 42.4566332,12.1570598 41.5520097,14.3461172 C40.6262113,13.0911005 41.2615631,11.2527663 37.7217458,11.2527663 C34.1819285,11.2527663 28.2459271,15.0178162 24.3067457,14.1693543 C25.6319081,12.8082799 34.5449866,8.15941549 31.059628,5.22515126 C30.7691815,7.3816587 28.6089853,8.45991242 27.7921043,7.47004016 C26.9752234,6.48016789 27.2293641,5.84382143 28.6089853,4.92465433 C26.8426293,4.66728886 25.0512452,4.61389039 23.2720299,4.76556771 C20.5796928,5.41103741 17.9859147,6.39753692 15.5570434,7.69983193 L15.3210556,8.95484856 L23.4172532,7.08116177 C23.1978905,7.76123129 23.2631293,8.49813187 23.5987823,9.13161146 C23.9799934,9.73260534 25.4140732,10.1921889 25.7952843,10.6517724 C25.7952843,11.8537602 18.8245671,14.5052038 18.8245671,14.5052038 C18.8245671,14.5052038 18.5885793,18.0404619 36.3602776,14.5052038 C39.7185658,13.7981522 38.9379907,15.4243709 38.9379907,15.4243709 C38.9379907,15.4243709 28.3911503,17.9697567 25.250697,18.5000454 C28.26408,24.5276605 29.9704535,28.8229991 36.5236538,31.1209168 C30.0067593,31.9693788 22.1102437,25.3230936 16.2650069,31.2800035 C9.00384308,38.7040455 17.1726523,53.4283954 19.2602369,57.6 C18.5159676,52.9688119 16.2831598,31.4037375 30.1519826,33.0653088 C45.0192154,34.8329378 63.7167121,46.8351391 68.2730924,48.9739702 C64.5154401,43.3705862 61.1026931,41.0196395 55.0577743,37.4313525 C49.6119015,34.1789151 35.5797025,29.7244899 31.1866984,21.6110726 C33.8188703,19.083363 36.4